# Out of the corridor into Work RAM's city (game/city.h), booted on foot (BOOT_ON_FOOT 1). The run
# as run_vault.steps: over the crate, up the stairs, off the platform onto the low roof (64), to the
# tower. Then a strafe left (south, +y) off the low roof's edge onto the floor of the corridor's
# right half, and out of the corridor's open end onto the entry tower's roof (level with the
# floor): the city below. Then a quarter turn left to face across the entry, a back-up for a
# run-up, and a run: over the street onto the next block (60 down) and on down through it.
# Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps city.steps
wait_up
hold up 13
shot ct_00_at_the_tower
hold l 3
wait 0.5
shot ct_01_right_half
keydown up
wait 0.6
shot ct_02_walking_out
wait 0.6
shot ct_03_the_opening
wait 0.6
shot ct_04_on_the_entry
keyup up
wait 0.5
shot ct_05_stood_on_the_entry
keydown x
wait 0.8
shot ct_06_looking_down_left
keyup x
keydown c
wait 1.2
shot ct_07_looking_down_right
keyup c
wait 0.6
hold left 0.7
wait 0.5
shot ct_08_facing_the_street
hold down 1.5
wait 0.3
keydown up
wait 0.8
shot ct_09_running
wait 0.25
shot ct_10_running
wait 0.25
shot ct_11_jump
wait 0.25
shot ct_12_jump
wait 0.25
shot ct_13_landed
wait 0.25
shot ct_14_on
wait 0.25
shot ct_15_on
wait 0.25
shot ct_16_on
wait 0.25
shot ct_17_on
wait 0.5
shot ct_18_on
wait 0.5
shot ct_19_on
keyup up
wait 1
shot ct_20_end
